# Snow Leopard compatibility patch 0020
#
# Incompatibility: Sparkle's old-SDK Touch Bar declarations still assume an
# availability spelling, collection generics, Auto Layout, and a 10.12 button
# factory absent from old SDKs.
# Behaviour preserved: runtime class lookup, delegate items, copied actions,
# tags, enabled state, Return key, button order, equal sizing, and 8 or 32 point
# gaps are retained. Touch Bar support remains live on systems that provide it.
# History: 56db200f and 40750b6f intentionally supplied old-SDK declarations.
# 118c72e6 added the custom button group and e2426784 added equal widths.
# No historical manual-layout implementation exists.
# Public API evidence: the replacement uses only 10.6 NSView and NSButton layout.
# The 10.12 factory remains selected dynamically when the class responds to it.
# Safety: no unavailable class symbol or private API is linked on Snow.
